This is incorrect. The roleMaps are deleted because they’re not used. Look at the code 😉

My modification is simple: if the user has no explicit role in the realm (e.g., they are not a member of the realm), but they do have the ability to update the site (via delegated access), then they should be seen as a maintain role (e.g., an Instructor) when launching into an LTI tool

