Note that there is a warning comment about this potential issue.

This code calls to DBUserService.DBStorage.getAll() which takes users from SAKAI_USER table, so external LDAP users are not included. In our production environment this query gets 49k users from a total of 115k.

A record for each notification is written in database and bullhorns notifications are sent for the 49k users. This causes the timeout.

