Tip for those using MySQL/MariaDB and adjusting to this new infrastructure: 

You will encounter problems during Sakai startup if you use a version specific MySQL dialect for hibernate.dialect in sakai.properties like:

{noformat}hibernate.dialect=org.hibernate.dialect.MySQL57InnoDBDialect {noformat}

The above class is no longer supported in Hibernate 6. Use the following instead:

{noformat}hibernate.dialect=org.hibernate.dialect.MySQLDialect{noformat}

