In the logs, I see the following warning:

{{SiteManageServiceImpl [WARN] Site Import Task encountered an exception for site ...}}

This appears to originate from {{SiteManageServiceImpl.importToolsIntoSiteThread}}.

The issue seems to be connected to the change in the  arguments  passed to this method. They were changed in {{SakaiScript.copySiteContent}} from:

{noformat}new ArrayList<>()
new HashMap<>(){noformat}

to:

{noformat}Collections.EMPTY_LIST
Collections.EMPTY_MAP{noformat}

However, these collections are immutable. As a result, calls such as the following fail in {{SiteManageServiceImpl.importToolsIntoSite}}:

{noformat}toolIds.addAll(importTools.keySet()){noformat}

because {{toolIds}} cannot be modified.

